{"articleNo":"2609","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2609&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010-2학기 대학원별 수료자등록 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.08.24","hit":"10618","attachments":[{"name":"수료자등록신청서(양식)1.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2609&attachNo=1948"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2010-2학기 대학원(일반, 산업 및 교육)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;수료자 등록 신청 안내&nbsp;<br></span></p><hr><p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;대학원(일반, 산업 및 교육) </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">수료자 중&nbsp; 2011년 2월</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> 학위를 받기위한 학위청구나 논문연구를 계속할 학생은 아래와 같이 수료자 등록을 신청하시기 바랍니다. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">1. 수료자등록 대상</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 일반대학원, 산업대학원, 교육대학원 수료생</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 본교 대학원 수료생은 누구나 신청(수료 후 논문제출 시한 폐지)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2. 수료자 등록구분 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; 가. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">일 반&nbsp; 등 록 :&nbsp; 논문연구를 계속하고자 하는 자 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">논문연구등록 :&nbsp; 논문연구학점 미 취득자(논문연구 불합격자) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">3. 수료자등록신청 및 접수</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; <strong>가. 수료자 추가 신청기간 : 2010. 8. 25(수) ~8. 26(목) [2일간]</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 수료자 등록신청 : 대학원지원팀(글로벌관 412호) 직접방문 신청</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br>4. 수료자 등록생 등록금 납부 금액 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">일반등록 : 등록금액의 5%, 논문연구등록: 등록금액의 10%</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 추가 납부기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2010. 8. 31(화) ~ 9. 2(목) [3일간] </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 고지서 출력방법 : 원스톱서비스/로그인/수료자관리/고지서출력</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 등록금 납부장소 : 농협</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 등록금 납부금액 : 수료자별 해당되는 등록금액 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLL